  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d8e9c4ee2d087d04d9b8cdf89c4f21bd, type: 3}
  m_Name: Lore1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  id: Lore_1
  title: The Forgotten Memory
  fullText: 'If you have awakened here once more... then our efforts were in vain.


    The
    cards were played poorly.

    Or perhaps they were chosen for us long before
    we ever arrived in this cursed place.


    I remember the bitter wind.

    Fading
    lights.

    The moon above.


    And her.

    The lady does not speak the
    whole truth.


    Pay close attention to the way she speaks of the cards.

    And
    to how her hands linger upon the crystal sphere.

    She already knows how this
    story ends.


    Walk carefully and...

    Try to Remember.'
